# Change Log

## 4.0.0

### Added

- Third-party storage support: 100 operations that address a file, folder or room (for example `getFileInfo`, `getFolderByFolderId`, `updateRoom`, `uploadFile`, the sharing and upload-session operations) take the identifier as `number | string`: a number addresses an entry stored on the portal, and a string an entry in a connected third-party storage (for example `"sbox-42"`); 39 of them that return a file, folder or upload session have typed overloads that return the portal model for a `number` identifier and the matching `ThirdParty*` model for a `string` one (`ThirdPartyFileWrapper`, `ThirdPartyFolderWrapper`, `ThirdPartyFolderContentWrapper`, `ThirdPartyChunkedUploadSessionWrapper` and others), and `saveFileAsPdf` and `startFileConversion` accept `ThirdPartySaveAsPdfRequest` and `ThirdPartyCheckConversionRequestDto` for such files
- Added the reworked AI API in `api/ai/`: `AIApi` (`api/ai/aiapi.ts`: sending messages with or without streaming, regenerating answers, approving and denying tool calls), `AssignmentsApi`, `AttachmentsApi`, `ContextApi`, `EditorToolsApi`, `ExportApi`, `OpenAIPassthroughApi`, `PreferencesApi`, `ProfilesApi`, `PromptsApi`, `ThreadsApi`, `ToolsApi` and `WebSearchApi`; the AI `SettingsApi` gains `aiSettingsGetToolMode` and `aiSettingsSetToolMode`
- Added `MetadataApi` (`api/files/metadata-api.ts`): metadata templates and their fields, assigning templates to files and folders, custom fields and field values; the new `searchFolder` (`FoldersApi`) and `searchRooms` (`RoomsApi`) find entries by their metadata, and files and folders carry `assignedMetadataTemplates` and `metadataMatches`
- Added `AppsApi` (`api/apps/`), `PrivacyRoomApi` (`api/rooms/privacy-room-api.ts`, the users' encryption keys for privacy rooms) and `DocsCloudApi` (`api/settings/docs-cloud-api.ts`)
- Added the operations `getFormsFolder` (`FoldersApi`), `getRoomAiFolder` (`RoomsApi`), `showQuickActions` (`FilesSettingsApi`), `getEncryptionInfo` and `setEncryptionInfo` (`FilesApi`) and `getEncryptionAccess` (`SharingApi`)
- Report generation: `createReportFolderHistory`, `createAuditTrailReport` and `createLoginHistoryReport` take `format`, `from` and `to` and return a `DocumentBuilderTaskWrapper`; the new `getReportFolderHistory`, `getAuditTrailReport`, `getLoginHistoryReport` and the matching `terminate*` operations follow and cancel the report
- Added the payment operations `getActiveServices`, `getAccountingServicePrices`, `getSubscriptionBalanceInfo`, `moveSubscriptionToWallet`, `getCustomerServiceUsage` and `getCustomerMonthlyUsage` with their `create*Report`, `get*Report` and `terminate*Report` operations (`PaymentApi`), and `getUpcomingPayments` (`PortalQuotaApi`)
- Added `getBackupsCounts` (`BackupApi`) and `refreshWebPlugin` (`WebpluginsApi`)
- Added the `origin` configuration parameter, which sends the given value in the `Origin` request header
- Added the sample `samples/example.ts`: it signs in with `authenticateMe`, checks that the `Origin` header is sent, and lists and creates rooms and reads the My documents folder
- Added model properties: `showQuickActions` to `FilesSettingsDto`, `formsUsedSpace` to `FilesStatisticsResultDto`, `ai` to `CustomizationConfigDto`, `isDelayedPaymentMethod` and `paymentMethodType` to `CustomerInfoDto`, `searchArea` to `RoomGroupDto` and `RoomGroupRequestDto`, `walletLowBalance` to `SettingsDto`, `runtime` to `WebPluginDto`, `toolPermissionMode` to `AiSettingsDto` and `AiUserSettingsDto`, `lastModified` to `TenantAiAccessSettingsDto`, `TenantBannerSettingsDto` and `TenantDevToolsAccessSettingsDto`, `errors` to `ProblemDetail`; `OperationDto` describes the source of a charge with `sourceId`, `sourceTitle`, `sourceType`, `cost` and `tokenUsage` instead of `agentId` and `agentTitle`, and `EditorToolCallStateDto.parameters` is an `EditorToolCallParametersDto` instead of an `object`
- Added enum values: `FolderType.Forms` (36) and `FolderType.Ai` (37); `SearchArea.Forms` and `SearchArea.FormTemplates`; `TenantWalletService.Admin`, `DocsCloud`, `DocsCloudDevPack` and `AISearch`; new audit actions in `MessageAction` (privacy room keys, metadata templates and values, AI profiles, Docs Cloud and others)
- Added the error body models `ErrorApiResponse` and `ValidationErrorResponse` (with `FieldError`)

### Changed

- Files, folders and rooms use one set of models for numeric identifiers: the `Integer` suffix is gone (`FileIntegerWrapper` → `FileWrapper`, `FolderIntegerWrapper` → `FolderWrapper`, `FolderContentIntegerWrapper` → `FolderContentWrapper`, `FileDtoInteger` → `FileDto`, `FolderDtoInteger` → `FolderDto`, `FileEntryDtoInteger` → `FileEntryDto`, `ConfigurationIntegerWrapper` → `ConfigurationWrapper`, `UploadSessionResponseIntegerWrapper` → `UploadSessionResponseWrapper`, `OrdersRequestDtoInteger` → `OrdersRequestDto`, `UpdateRoomsQuotaRequestDtoInteger` → `UpdateRoomsQuotaRequestDto`, `SaveAsPdfInteger` → `SaveAsPdfRequest`, `DraftLocationInteger` → `DraftLocation` and so on), and the `String` variants became `ThirdParty*` models (`FolderStringWrapper` → `ThirdPartyFolderWrapper`, `FolderDtoString` → `ThirdPartyFolderDto`, `FileEntryDtoString` → `ThirdPartyFileEntryDto`); the chunked-upload operations return `ChunkedUploadSessionWrapper` and `ChunkedUploadSessionResultWrapper`; the nested share models of files and folders are `AiFileEntryDtoAllOfShareSettings`, `AiFileEntryDtoAllOfSecurity` and `AiFileEntryDtoAllOfAvailableShareRights` (were `FileEntryDtoIntegerAllOfShareSettings`, `FileEntryDtoIntegerAllOfSecurity` and `FileEntryDtoIntegerAllOfAvailableShareRights`)
- Renamed the request models with the plural `Requests` to the singular (`AuthRequestsDto` → `AuthRequestDto`, `SsoSettingsRequestsDto` → `SsoSettingsRequestDto`, `TfaRequestsDto` → `TfaRequestDto`, `StorageRequestsDto` → `StorageRequestDto`, `CspRequestsDto` → `CspRequestDto`, `WhiteLabelRequestsDto` → `WhiteLabelRequestDto`, `WebPluginRequests` → `WebPluginRequest` and the rest), and the JSON bodies nested in a request take a `Request` suffix (`Delete` → `DeleteFileRequest`, `DeleteFolder` → `DeleteFolderRequest`, `CreateFolder` → `CreateFolderRequest`, `CreateFileJsonElement` → `CreateFileRequest`, `CreateTextOrHtmlFile` → `CreateTextOrHtmlFileRequest`, `CopyAsJsonElement` → `CopyAsRequest`, `UpdateFile` → `UpdateFileRequest`, `UpdateComment` → `UpdateCommentRequest`, `ChangeHistory` → `ChangeHistoryRequest`, `CheckFillFormDraft` → `CheckFillFormDraftRequest`, `CustomFilterParameters` → `CustomFilterRequest`, `CreateThirdPartyRoom` → `CreateThirdPartyRoomRequest`, `LockFileParameters` → `LockFileRequest`, `StartEdit` → `StartEditRequest`, `Culture` → `UpdateMemberCultureRequest`, `MentionMessageWrapper` → `MentionMessageRequest`, `EmailValidationKeyModel` → `CheckConfirmRequestDto`); the JSON sent is unchanged, but the request body is passed in the `requestParameters` property named after the new model (`{ createFolder }` → `{ createFolderRequest }`, `{ authRequestsDto }` → `{ authRequestDto }`, `{ _delete }` → `{ deleteFileRequest }` and so on)
- Renamed the request parameters that ran words together: `userid` → `userId` (`getProfileByUserId`, `updateMember`, `deleteMember`, `changeUserEmail`, `changeUserPassword`, the photo operations, `getGroupByUserId`, `getGuestSharingLink`, the reassign, remove and user type progress operations), `userID` → `userId` (`getUserById`), `productid` → `productId` and `userid` → `userId` (`getIsProductAdministrator`, `getProductAdministrators`), `activationstatus` → `activationStatus` (`updateUserActivationStatus`); `setFileSecurityInfo` and `setFolderSecurityInfo` take the entry as `id` instead of `fileId` and `folderId`, and the list bodies of `changeDefaultAccessRights` and `deleteTemplates` are `defaultAccessRightsRequestDto` and `deleteTemplateFilesRequestDto` instead of `requestBody`
- Renamed the API classes whose names now belong to the reworked AI API: the People `ProfilesApi` → `PeopleProfilesApi` (`api/people/people-profiles-api.ts`), so `ProfilesApi` is now the AI profiles API, and `SettingsMessagesApi` → `MessagesApi` (`api/settings/messages-api.ts`), the name of the removed AI `MessagesApi`
- Settings, database entities and other server-side classes are no longer published as models: each one became a `Dto` of the same shape (`TenantQuota` → `TenantQuotaDto`, `Balance` → `BalanceDto`, `Tariff` → `TariffDto`, `BackupProgress` → `BackupProgressDto`, `CoEditingConfig` → `CoEditingConfigDto`, `Logo` → `LogoDto`, `StorageSettings` and `CdnStorageSettings` → `StorageSettingsDto`, `DarkThemeSettings` → `DarkThemeSettingsDto`, `WizardSettings` → `WizardSettingsDto`, `TenantWalletServiceSettings` → `TenantWalletServiceSettingsDto`, the editor configuration models `PermissionsConfig`, `EmbeddedConfig`, `UserConfig`, `FeedbackConfig` and the rest → `*ConfigDto` and so on) or a model named after what it carries (`UserInfo` → `PortalUserDto`, also as the `user` of `MentionDto`, `FireBaseUser` → `FirebaseDeviceDto`, `ThirdPartyParams` → `ThirdPartyAccountDto`, `CompanyWhiteLabelSettings` → `LicensorDetailsDto`, `AdditionalWhiteLabelSettings` → `AdditionalResourcesDto`, `SsoSettingsV2` → `SsoSettingsDto`, `IPRestriction` → `IpRestrictionDto`, `IpRestrictionBase` → `IpRestrictionEntryDto`, `SetupCode` → `TfaSetupCodeDto`, `IMagickGeometry` → `WhiteLabelItemSizeDto`, `PasswordHasher` → `PasswordHashSettingsDto`, `TenantDomainValidator` → `DomainNameRulesDto`, `CultureSpecificExternalResources` → `ExternalResourcesDto`, `TenantEntityQuotaSettings` → `EntityQuotaDto`); the room, user and AI agent quota settings are all returned as `EntityQuotaSettingsWrapper`
- The settings sent in a request body take the name of their operation and keep every field (`TenantWalletSettingsWrapper` → `TenantWalletSettingsRequestDto` with `SetWalletTopUpSettingsRequest`, `TenantAuditSettingsWrapper` → `TenantAuditSettingsRequestDto` with `SetAuditLifetimeSettingsRequest`, `CompanyWhiteLabelSettingsWrapper` → `CompanyWhiteLabelSettingsRequestDto` with `SaveCompanyInfoRequest`, `AdditionalWhiteLabelSettingsWrapper` → `AdditionalWhiteLabelSettingsRequestDto` with `SaveAdditionalResourcesRequest`, `TenantAiAccessSettingsDto` → `TenantAiAccessSettingsRequestDto`, `TenantBannerSettingsDto` → `TenantBannerSettingsRequestDto`, `TenantDevToolsAccessSettingsDto` → `TenantDevToolsAccessSettingsRequestDto`, `ExternalDatabaseSettings` → `ExternalDatabaseConnectionRequestDto`, `EmailActivationSettings` → `EmailActivationSettingsRequestDto`); `TenantWalletSettingsWrapper`, `TenantAuditSettingsWrapper`, `CompanyWhiteLabelSettingsWrapper` and `AdditionalWhiteLabelSettingsWrapper` return the settings in `response` instead of a `settings` property; `saveAuthKeys` takes `SaveAuthKeysRequestDto` and `getAuthServices` returns `AuthServiceArrayWrapper`
- Renamed other models whose names did not say what they carry: `Status` → `ExternalShareStatus`, `Options` → `DocumentOptionsDto`, `STRINGArrayWrapper` → `StringArrayWrapper`, `EncryprtionStatus` → `EncryptionStatus`, `AceShortWrapper` → `AceShortDto`, `MentionWrapper` → `MentionDto`, `TimezonesRequestsDto` → `TimezoneDto`, `GroupMemberSecurityRequestDto` → `GroupMemberSecurityDto`, `SmtpOperationStatusRequestsDto` → `SmtpOperationStatusDto`, `KeyValuePairBooleanString` → `ItemKeyValuePairBooleanString`, `HistoryData` → `HistoryDataDto`, `HistoryAction` → `HistoryActionDto`, `Area` → `AccountSearchArea`, `Location` → `RequestLocation`, `TfaRequestsDtoType` → `TfaType`, `TenantWalletServiceSettingsEnabledServicesEnum` → `TenantWalletServiceSettingsDtoEnabledServicesEnum`, and the backup request models after their operation (`BackupDto` → `StartBackupRequestDto`, `BackupRestoreDto` → `StartBackupRestoreRequestDto`, `BackupScheduleDto` → `CreateBackupScheduleRequestDto`, `Cron` → `BackupCronRequest`, `CronParams` → `CronParamsDto`)
- Operations that returned an untyped `ObjectWrapper` or `ObjectArrayWrapper` now return a typed model: `StringWrapper` (`getPortalPath`, `getPortalHostname`, `getGreetingSettings`, `getThirdPartyCode`), `StringArrayWrapper` (`getRoomTagsInfo`), `TokenDiagnosticsWrapper` (`getClaims`), `AuditTrailProductArrayWrapper` (`getAuditTrailMappers`), `AuditTrailTypesWrapper` (`getAuditTrailTypes`), `EnabledModuleArrayWrapper` (`getEnabledModules`), `SocketSettingsWrapper` (`getSocketSettings`), `SsoSettingsConstantsWrapper` (`getSsoSettingsV2Constants`), `AmazonS3RegionArrayWrapper` (`getAmazonS3Regions`), `AccountEntryArrayWrapper` (`getAccountsEntriesWith*Shared`)
- Other return types: `deleteFileVersions` returns `FileOperationArrayWrapper`, `searchUsersByQuery` returns `EmployeeFullArrayWrapper`, `changeDefaultAccessRights` returns `FileShareResponseArrayWrapper`, `updateCdnStorage` returns `StorageSettingsWrapper`, `getAiPrices` returns `AiPricesWrapper`, `getRestrictedAiModels` and `setRestrictedAiModels` return `RestrictedAiModelsWrapper`; `deleteGroup` and `deleteRecent` return `void`
- Renamed the AI operations after their tag, so the method names change: `createAgent` → `aiAgentsCreate`, `getAgents` → `aiAgentsList`, `getAgentInfo` → `aiAgentsGet`, `getAgentsNewItems` → `aiAgentsNews`, `updateAgent` → `aiAgentsUpdate`, `deleteAgent` → `aiAgentsDelete`, `updateAgentsQuota` → `aiAgentsUpdateQuota`, `resetAgentsQuota` → `aiAgentsResetQuota`, `getAiSettings` → `aiSettingsGet`, `getAiUserSettings` → `aiSettingsGetUser`, `setAiUserSettings` → `aiSettingsSetUser`, `getVectorizationSettings` → `aiSettingsGetVectorization`, `setVectorizationSettings` → `aiSettingsSetVectorization`, `startTask` → `aiVectorizationStartTask`; in Files, `changeDownloadZipFromBody` → `changeDownloadZip`
- The AI agent operations take the agent `id` as a `string` and use their own `Ai`-prefixed models (`AiFolderWrapper`, `AiFolderContentWrapper`, `AiFileOperationWrapper`, `AiAgentsCreateRequest`, `AiAgentsUpdateRequest`, `AiAgentsDeleteRequest` and others) instead of the models of the Files API; the request bodies of `aiAgentsCreate`, `aiAgentsUpdateQuota`, `aiAgentsResetQuota` and `aiSettingsSetUser` are required; `aiAgentsList` takes `quotaFilter` as a `number` and `sortOrder` as a `string`; `aiSettingsSetUser` and `aiSettingsSetVectorization` take the settings as a `{ [key: string]: any | null; }`; `aiSettingsGetVectorization` and `aiSettingsSetVectorization` return `AiVectorizationSettingsWrapper`, and `aiVectorizationStartTask` returns `AiVectorizationStartTask200Response` instead of nothing
- The AI operations are declared with the new `cookieAuth` and `bearerAuth` schemes instead of `Basic`, `OAuth2`, `ApiKeyBearer`, `asc_auth_key`, `Bearer` and `OpenId`, so they send only the `accessToken` set in `Configuration` (as `Authorization: Bearer`); the `username` and `password` and the `apiKey` set there are no longer applied to them
- 49 operations that the portal also serves without signing in (among them `getFileInfo`, `getFolderByFolderId`, `getFolderInfo`, `getRoomInfo`, `openEditFile`, `updateFile`, `getFilesSettings`, `getPortalSettings` and `authenticateMe`) now send the credentials set in `Configuration`; before, they were always called anonymously
- The OAuth 2.0 client and scope operations call `/api/2.0/oauth2/clients` and `/api/2.0/oauth2/scopes` instead of `/api/2.0/clients` and `/api/2.0/scopes`; `getClients` returns `PageableClientResponse` instead of `PageableResponse` and its `limit` is optional, `getClientsInfo` returns `PageableClientInfoResponse` (renamed from `PageableResponseClientInfoResponse`), `getScopes` returns `Array<ScopeResponse>` instead of one `ScopeResponse`, and `changeActivation`, `deleteClient`, `deleteTenantClients`, `deleteUserClients`, `revokeUserClient`, `updateClient` and `handleOptions` return `void` instead of `object`; `CreateClientRequest` requires `name`, `logo`, `scopes`, `website_url`, `terms_url`, `policy_url` and `logout_redirect_uri`, and `UpdateClientRequest` requires `name`, `logo`, `allowed_origins` and the new `scopes` and `redirect_uris`
- `checkMoveOrCopyBatchItems` (`GET /api/2.0/files/fileops/move`) and `checkMoveOrCopyDestFolder` (`GET /api/2.0/files/fileops/checkdestfolder`) take the batch as separate query parameters (`returnSingleOperation`, `folderIds`, `fileIds`, `destFolderId`, `conflictResolveType`, `deleteAfter`, `content`, `toFillOut`) instead of one `inDto` object, which is how the server reads them
- New and changed request parameters: the folder listings `getMyFolder`, `getFavoritesFolder`, `getRecentFolder`, `getTrashFolder`, `getFolderByFolderId` and `getRoomsFolder` take `metadataTemplateId` and `metadataFilters`; `getFolderByFolderId` also takes `folderType`, takes `roomId` as `number | string`, and its `location` is a `RequestLocation`; `getRoomsFolder` no longer takes `subjectFilter` and takes `privacyFilter` and `withAiFolder`; `emptyTrash` takes `folderType` and `getPaymentQuotas` takes `additional`; `getRoomGroups` no longer takes the required `id` and takes `searchArea`, so its `requestParameters` can be omitted
- Parameter and property types: the date filters of `getFileHistory`, `getFolderHistory`, `getAuditEventsByFilter` and `getLoginEventsByFilter` are `string` instead of `ApiDateTime`; `serviceName` of `getCustomerOperations` and of `CustomerOperationsReportRequestDto` is `Array<string>`; `EditorConfigurationDto.encryptionKeys` is `Array<EncryptionKeyDto>` instead of `EncryptionKeysConfig`; `TariffDto.dueDate`, `delayDueDate` and `licenseDate` and `TariffQuotaDto.dueDate` are `ApiDateTime` instead of `string`, and `TariffDto` has `openSource`, `enterprise` and `developer` instead of `overdueQuotas`; `RoomTemplateDto.title` and the `quantity` of `PaymentUrlRequestDto`, `QuantityRequestDto` and `WalletQuantityRequestDto` are required
- `SearchArea` is sent and received as a string instead of a number (`SearchArea.Active` is `'Active'` instead of `0`, and so on); `FolderType.ResultStorage` (33) is now `FolderType.ChatOutputs`
- Regenerated with OpenAPI Generator 7.24.0

### Removed

- Removed the superseded AI API classes `ChatApi`, `MCPApi`, `MessagesApi` and `ProvidersApi` (`api/ai/chat-api.ts`, `mcpapi.ts`, `messages-api.ts`, `providers-api.ts`) together with their models (`ChatDto`, `MessageDto`, `McpServerDto`, `AiProviderDto`, `ModelDto`, `UserChatSettingsDto`, `WebSearchSettingsDto` and others); the web search settings moved from `getWebSearchSettings`/`setWebSearchSettings` to `WebSearchApi`
- Removed the request models `SetAiUserSettingsRequestDto` and `SetEmbeddingConfigRequestBody`, the `AiSettingsDto` properties that described the old AI chat (`webSearchEnabled`, `webSearchNeedReset`, `aiReadyNeedReset`, `portalMcpServerId`, `modelAliases`, the `*ToolName` properties) and the model properties of `ChatSettingsDto` (`providerId`, `modelId`, `modelAlias`, `capabilities`, `multimodal`, `thinking`, `internal`)
- Removed `getPrivacyFolder` (`FoldersApi`), `isAvailablePrivacyRoomSettings` (`FilesSettingsApi`), `getCustomerAiBalance` and `creditAiBalance` (`PaymentApi`)
- Removed the `subjectFilter` parameter of `getRoomsFolder` and `aiAgentsList` with its `SubjectFilter` enum, the `MessageAction` values `PrivacyRoomEnable` and `PrivacyRoomDisable`, and the `public` property of the OAuth 2.0 client models
- Removed the models that no operation uses any more: `DbTenant`, `DbTenantPartner`, `AuthData`, `OAuth20Token`, `NoContentResult`, `NoContentResultWrapper`, `StatusCodeResult`, `ObjectWrapper`, `UploadRequestDto`, `ContentDisposition`, `ContentType`, `ErrorResponse`, `SexEnum`, `KeyValuePairStringStringValues` and `BuyWalletServiceRequestDto`
- Removed `error.ts` with the `DocSpaceApiError` class: the package entry point did not export it and no operation threw it
- The third-party accounts returned by `getThirdPartyAccounts` no longer have the `auth_data` property, and the devices returned by `docRegisterPusnNotificationDevice` and `subscribeDocumentsPushNotification` no longer have `tenant`; neither was ever filled in

